{
  "bookId": "hero-214018",
  "id": "bond-29332",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29332001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "|101|……咦，我刚才睡着了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29332002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不好意思，送你礼物后就有事离开了，现在才回来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29332003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "怎么样，还喜欢吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29332004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "「帕拉斯」和我都很喜欢这个基地，有很多能联网的终端设备。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29332005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "但是……为什么准备了这么孩子气的娱乐室？还有很多毛茸茸的玩偶……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29332006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "需要去掉吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29332007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "既然已经建了就留着吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29332008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……看来泉的建议还是有点用处的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29332009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那就正式感谢你帮我夺得了《终焉地平线》的社区联赛冠军。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29332010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "只是个规模很小的赛事，你没有我的建议也能够获胜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29332011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "我其实并不值得这样贵重的——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29332012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "停，这是你应得的哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "29332014",
              "text": "你的努力值得尊重"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "29332014",
              "text": "没有你的鼓励，我也不会参赛"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "29332013",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29332014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "好吧，接下来我会表现得更称职的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29332015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这可不是工作啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29332016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那么，可以回答我之前的问题了吧，你在这里过得还愉快吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29332017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "当然了……我已经不像刚活化的时候那样迷茫了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29332018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "你和你的手办们教会了我，这具树脂的身体也有很多能够追求的东西。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29332019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你说话也变得拐弯抹角了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29332020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……那你就把耳朵凑过来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29332021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯，像这样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
